From 373f7c26499ec027d6b5ba77544a46e2bd4cb87a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ziyuw-Plank <236070466+ziyuw-Plank@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:44:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(desktop): enable Linux window drag via
 -webkit-app-region
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Linux primary windows use titleBarStyle:hidden without titleBarOverlay, but
base.css only applied mark→drag rules under data-platform=darwin. On Wayland
(and X11) that left a frameless window with no drag surface.

Extend the darwin drag / recall / interactive no-drag rules to linux, and
mirror the dockkit + conversation header cluster subtractions so controls and
split dividers stay clickable. Onboarding dragBand geometry follows.
